{"version":1,"content":"<p>奇瑞集團法務部近日發佈《關於冒用「奇瑞集團」「奇瑞汽車」名義開展虛假招聘的警示》，回應此前的招聘爭議。此前，網絡上流傳出「奇瑞汽車河南工學院」招聘羣中「不要急於了解薪資待遇」的截圖，被網友認為涉嫌PUA，引發爭議。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586240.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:28:39.948815+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:10:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.278990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.278990+00:00","content_hash":"404de39f6c0aa19099ece3208179b222a5742107cabb164e35c5ccab9089acbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}